<title>JAPAN: SOCCER-JAPAN J.LEAGUE RESULTS, STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-JAPAN J.LEAGUE RESULTS, STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
